WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:04.360
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.500 --> 00:07.530
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.040 --> 00:10.770
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.770 --> 00:15.400
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.840 --> 00:22.810
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.550 --> 00:27.420
Dragon Drive

00:27.420 --> 00:32.920
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.060 --> 00:36.030
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.030 --> 00:39.260
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.770 --> 00:44.140
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.140 --> 00:46.110
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.110 --> 00:52.410
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.150 --> 00:56.520
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.520 --> 00:59.720
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.060 --> 01:05.060
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.060 --> 01:06.620
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.760 --> 01:09.160
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.160 --> 01:12.290
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.700 --> 01:17.770
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.770 --> 01:20.510
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.510 --> 01:28.180
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.930 --> 01:42.420
Are you going against me?

01:42.500 --> 01:45.330
Don't blame me
if it doesn't go like you want it to!

01:51.040 --> 01:52.530
Yes! This is the place!

01:52.610 --> 01:55.100
Inside those clouds is
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons!

01:58.110 --> 01:58.980
Reiji!

01:59.050 --> 02:02.210
Mhm. I feel it. Something really awful.

02:02.280 --> 02:03.910
Go, Kanper!!

02:05.620 --> 02:07.920
I'll just force my way through this!

02:08.620 --> 02:12.560
Those who break the seal
anger the Four Sacred Dragons, and perish.

02:21.800 --> 02:24.270
They've awakened. The Four Sacred Dragons.

02:26.010 --> 02:29.310
Rival

02:33.850 --> 02:34.970
These dragons...

02:35.320 --> 02:36.280
Mhm.

02:36.420 --> 02:38.480
Must be the Four Sacred Dragons
that protect the Shrine!

02:41.820 --> 02:43.810
Wow! They look powerful!

02:43.960 --> 02:46.550
I'll go and get Shinryu
while they're preoccupied with each other!

02:48.860 --> 02:49.990
Kouhei!

02:50.060 --> 02:51.260
I won't let you!

03:01.880 --> 03:03.280
Too bad!

03:07.980 --> 03:09.180
How'd it get there?!

03:12.650 --> 03:15.020
Hideaki! Mahiru!

03:15.320 --> 03:16.810
Where are you?!

03:16.890 --> 03:19.220
Darn it! They're absolutely useless!

03:25.270 --> 03:29.530
Right now, we may be able to protect
the stone that Shinryu is sealed in.

03:29.970 --> 03:31.200
Maiko!

03:31.810 --> 03:33.170
I'm going with you!

03:33.470 --> 03:34.700
Mhm!

03:41.750 --> 03:44.880
That's where Shinryu is sealed.

03:57.630 --> 03:58.600
Meguru!

04:02.740 --> 04:03.900
Are you all right?

04:04.040 --> 04:05.010
Yes.

04:15.850 --> 04:18.080
They seem to be totally pissed off!

04:18.820 --> 04:23.550
I think they're mad because "somebody"
tried to force his way into the Shrine.

04:23.790 --> 04:26.490
What?! A-Are you saying this is my fault?!

04:26.960 --> 04:30.490
Stop it, this isn't the time
to be pointing fingers at anybody!

04:36.440 --> 04:37.400
Damn you!

04:37.510 --> 04:41.200
I went easy on you because you're guardians,
but enough's enough!

04:41.440 --> 04:42.410
Go!

04:42.540 --> 04:43.370
No!

04:43.440 --> 04:46.440
If you lose your cool, you've got no chance
against the Four Sacred Dragons!

04:46.550 --> 04:49.040
Then what must I do to win?!

04:49.420 --> 04:52.650
If we keep running away,
we'll eventually be beaten!

04:53.820 --> 04:55.410
W-Well...

05:00.260 --> 05:01.390
That's right.

05:01.700 --> 05:04.960
You've all gotta fight more desperately.

05:05.370 --> 05:08.130
And while you're fighting for your lives...

05:08.340 --> 05:12.140
...I'll be able to take
the stone with Shinryu in it.

05:13.370 --> 05:14.340
Meguru.

05:14.810 --> 05:17.140
Once I'm done with that,
I'll come back to save you.

05:17.980 --> 05:21.140
If you can survive until then, that is.

05:28.620 --> 05:31.320
Reiji, I'll immobilize the dragon.

05:31.790 --> 05:33.690
That'll give you the chance to destroy it!

05:33.960 --> 05:35.990
B-But Mr. Taiyou!

05:36.060 --> 05:37.500
No. It's our only chance!

05:38.000 --> 05:39.830
I have nothing against
the Four Sacred Dragons...

05:39.900 --> 05:42.500
...but we must hurry if we're gonna
keep Kouhei from taking Shinryu!

05:43.340 --> 05:44.500
All right!

05:54.580 --> 05:56.070
Let's do it, Chibi!

05:56.420 --> 05:59.010
SinnSaber!

06:15.170 --> 06:16.760
Hurry, Reiji!

06:23.340 --> 06:25.840
If I miss, I might also hit Mr. Taiyou.

06:26.410 --> 06:27.380
Reiji!

06:28.120 --> 06:29.410
Fire!

06:29.480 --> 06:30.350
Hurry!

06:52.870 --> 06:54.310
Fight me, Rockaku!

06:54.610 --> 06:56.270
Do you only know how to run?!

06:57.350 --> 07:02.110
So you finally realized
that I'm an expert at running away!

07:02.350 --> 07:03.580
Bastard!

07:11.360 --> 07:13.350
Come after me, Mahiru.

07:13.590 --> 07:16.590
I can't allow you to give Kouhei a hand!

07:22.270 --> 07:24.970
Stop playing around
and come join me, will you?

07:25.440 --> 07:26.630
Or I'll get mad.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.270
Mr. Kouhei...

07:34.450 --> 07:36.540
I can't afford to spend time with that thing!

07:38.820 --> 07:40.550
Mahiru!

07:43.420 --> 07:44.360
Rockaku!!

07:54.840 --> 07:56.130
Mahiru.

07:56.200 --> 07:58.300
You need to stay still for the time being.

08:04.250 --> 08:08.080
Even without me,
we have seven against their three.

08:08.480 --> 08:10.680
There's no way we'd lose.

08:12.050 --> 08:13.320
I'm not so sure about that.

08:15.720 --> 08:18.490
H-Hi, Kyoji.

08:18.790 --> 08:21.960
Did you by chance follow me?

08:22.160 --> 08:24.150
Well, something like that.

08:26.730 --> 08:30.030
Why won't you at least
observe the final battle?

08:31.010 --> 08:34.170
I have no interest in battles!

08:34.540 --> 08:37.670
Won't you come to pick me up
once the battle is over?

08:42.020 --> 08:43.510
Wh-What is it?

08:43.820 --> 08:46.650
Giving me a stern look
isn't gonna convince me to go!

08:47.460 --> 08:50.320
U-U-Using force to take me
isn't gonna work in this day and age!

08:50.890 --> 08:52.880
- Huh?
- This feather.

08:56.830 --> 08:58.360
Why, that's...

08:59.470 --> 09:02.660
What in the world is this...

09:04.340 --> 09:05.600
...doing here?

09:15.020 --> 09:16.540
Reiji! Now's your chance!

09:16.650 --> 09:17.620
Do it!

09:17.990 --> 09:18.970
All right!

09:19.850 --> 09:22.720
It's not gonna be that easy, is it?!

09:30.130 --> 09:30.960
What?!

09:36.640 --> 09:37.630
Reiji!

09:37.710 --> 09:39.400
K-Kouhei!

09:41.480 --> 09:44.070
I present to you your next opponent!
Good luck!

09:46.650 --> 09:49.340
K-Kouhei!

09:57.290 --> 10:00.060
It's... It's my fault.

10:00.800 --> 10:04.460
All because I tried
to force my way into the Shrine.

10:12.040 --> 10:14.010
I screwed up!

10:14.510 --> 10:15.480
Daisuke!

10:15.710 --> 10:17.770
What are you getting all depressed about?!

10:18.080 --> 10:21.780
With Kouhei Toki confronting us here,
this would've happened anyway!

10:22.020 --> 10:23.380
Stop whining to yourself!

10:23.850 --> 10:25.440
M-Maiko!

10:27.720 --> 10:29.190
Don't cry over what can't be undone!

10:29.260 --> 10:32.120
Think about how to deal
with the present danger!

10:32.560 --> 10:34.590
I-Ichirou.

10:35.030 --> 10:37.790
My Sweet Honey!

10:38.700 --> 10:39.860
I'm sorry.

10:39.930 --> 10:42.400
If I remembered everything
about the Shrine more clearly...

10:42.670 --> 10:44.070
...this wouldn't have happened.

10:44.140 --> 10:45.630
Don't worry about it.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.470
We'll get through this.

10:47.540 --> 10:49.630
Hey, which one looks weaker?!

10:49.940 --> 10:52.380
Wh-What are you asking, all of a sudden?!

10:52.810 --> 10:55.340
We're not likely to defeat
both of them at once!

10:55.750 --> 10:58.810
So we should concentrate our attacks
on the weaker dragon!

10:59.650 --> 11:00.950
They're right!

11:01.590 --> 11:03.520
This is no time to regret what I can't undo!

11:03.920 --> 11:06.220
B-But they both look really strong!

11:17.140 --> 11:20.700
We just lost the luxury
of choosing which one to fight.

11:21.740 --> 11:24.910
What in the world
are you thinking, Daisuke?!

11:29.850 --> 11:31.880
I've completely lost sight
of Kouhei and his guys!

11:32.320 --> 11:34.450
Their plan is to force
the Four Sacred Dragons on us...

11:34.520 --> 11:36.080
...and enter the Shrine!

11:52.910 --> 11:57.440
All that's left now is to get rid
of the guys surrounding the Shrine.

11:57.510 --> 11:58.940
Way to go, big brother.

11:59.180 --> 12:00.880
You're so smart.

12:03.720 --> 12:06.080
You rascal. When'd you get there?

12:06.950 --> 12:08.080
Let's go.

12:08.460 --> 12:10.720
You have the key to the Shrine, right?

12:11.560 --> 12:13.550
Stop giving me orders, I'm telling ya!

12:19.930 --> 12:21.560
It vanished! What just happened?!

12:22.170 --> 12:24.160
I don't know, but this is our chance!

12:24.610 --> 12:26.230
Let's defeat the remaining one!

12:26.340 --> 12:28.210
No. Wait, Mr. Taiyou!

12:28.510 --> 12:30.000
I'll take care of it!

12:30.080 --> 12:31.040
But...

12:31.180 --> 12:33.310
Please go and help Maiko's group!

12:38.490 --> 12:42.150
He's struggling in this battle,
yet his mind is on the safety of the others.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.450
You're quite something, Reiji!

12:47.560 --> 12:49.790
Let's go, Chibi!

13:13.050 --> 13:15.580
This data... I've never seen anything like it.

13:16.560 --> 13:19.080
They must be in
a seriously intense battle.

13:21.760 --> 13:24.460
It's a battle to make way for a new world.

13:25.830 --> 13:27.300
It won't end that easily.

13:27.900 --> 13:30.300
Let me know if you see any changes.

13:39.110 --> 13:44.070
This seems to be turning
into something incredible.

13:45.620 --> 13:46.750
Well then...

13:48.460 --> 13:49.650
...what now?

13:55.030 --> 13:56.500
At this rate...

14:15.350 --> 14:16.820
Y-You're...

14:18.620 --> 14:19.380
Hikaru!

14:28.600 --> 14:31.290
Finally decided to wake up, little boy?

14:32.130 --> 14:33.330
Rockaku!

14:33.470 --> 14:36.230
B-Bastard! Why didn't you finish me off?!

14:39.370 --> 14:40.670
Finish you off?

14:40.740 --> 14:42.300
You're talking awfully big...

14:42.780 --> 14:45.210
...for someone who's been lying here
unconscious for the longest time.

14:45.410 --> 14:46.670
Don't you make fun of me!

14:47.550 --> 14:48.520
Mahiru!

14:48.620 --> 14:50.020
Tell me one thing.

14:50.080 --> 14:51.550
What is Kouhei to you?

14:51.820 --> 14:53.880
I have no obligation to answer that!

14:57.360 --> 14:58.720
Answer me, Mahiru!

14:59.190 --> 15:01.020
What is Kouhei to you?!

15:02.360 --> 15:03.990
Answer me, Mahiru!

15:04.270 --> 15:05.430
Tell me, will ya?!

15:06.630 --> 15:09.300
Kouhei's presence is irrelevant!

15:09.640 --> 15:13.400
I just used him to get back at you!

15:15.080 --> 15:16.200
I see.

15:16.310 --> 15:18.280
I'm relieved to hear that.

15:18.580 --> 15:19.840
This is for my big brother!

15:21.520 --> 15:24.280
I... I'll... never forgive you...

15:26.250 --> 15:28.350
Roc... kaku...

15:29.690 --> 15:32.350
I'll take you on
when we're done with this battle.

15:36.400 --> 15:37.420
Reiji Ohzora!

15:38.170 --> 15:39.560
H-Hikaru.

15:39.630 --> 15:40.930
You're not attacking me, are you?

15:43.000 --> 15:44.800
Wh-What are you thinking?

15:44.870 --> 15:46.460
Now isn't the time!

15:50.880 --> 15:52.070
Don't let your guard down!

15:52.150 --> 15:53.370
The battle's not over yet!

15:54.480 --> 15:55.380
Hikaru!

15:57.850 --> 15:59.680
Hikaru! You've got no chance
fighting against them alone!

16:01.120 --> 16:02.090
Canopus!

16:13.600 --> 16:14.590
Wh-What?

16:18.040 --> 16:20.730
Let's get rid of those in our way, Canopus.

16:24.650 --> 16:25.610
Awesome.

16:25.780 --> 16:27.410
Canopus transformed!

16:29.350 --> 16:30.820
We'll destroy it!

16:30.950 --> 16:31.940
Come, Reiji!

16:33.390 --> 16:34.450
Oh, boy...

16:34.520 --> 16:37.050
His snobbish attitude
hasn't changed one bit.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.420
Let's go, Chibi!

16:52.140 --> 16:53.000
Hikaru.

16:53.270 --> 16:55.260
Let's put an end to that one.

16:55.480 --> 16:57.340
Chibi! We'll use SinnSaber!

17:08.220 --> 17:08.850
Reiji!

17:09.560 --> 17:11.720
Aim carefully, Chibi!

17:11.890 --> 17:14.050
This battle will still continue.

17:14.130 --> 17:15.690
We can't waste too much power.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.860
Make sure you hit the target, Chibi!

17:22.200 --> 17:23.670
Missed again?!

17:23.800 --> 17:25.360
Don't blame your dragon!

17:26.240 --> 17:29.640
You're missing because you're frightened
by the immense power produced!

17:31.710 --> 17:33.940
Trust your dragon's abilities!

17:35.020 --> 17:37.540
Because... I'm frightened?

17:46.460 --> 17:49.900
Because I'm telling myself that I mustn't use
this uncontrollable power.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.400
Is that right, Chibi?

17:55.440 --> 17:56.560
One more time.

17:56.900 --> 17:58.270
I'm counting on you, Chibi!

18:04.710 --> 18:06.240
GO!!

18:19.690 --> 18:20.720
We did it.

18:22.330 --> 18:24.260
We did it, Chibi!

18:24.870 --> 18:27.360
It took you long enough
to finally control that power.

18:27.430 --> 18:28.900
How disappointing.

18:29.600 --> 18:31.040
Thank you, Hikaru.

18:31.710 --> 18:33.260
Don't get me wrong.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.440
I've done nothing to be thanked for.

18:37.180 --> 18:39.610
Fight me, Reiji Ohzora!

18:40.180 --> 18:41.270
Hikaru.

18:42.080 --> 18:43.170
Please understand!

18:43.550 --> 18:45.280
Everyone's fighting now!

18:45.790 --> 18:47.880
This is our final bout!

18:49.990 --> 18:53.120
This battle is our final battle!

18:57.400 --> 18:59.230
Why won't you understand?!

19:00.530 --> 19:03.230
I've always been alone.

19:03.540 --> 19:04.400
Huh?

19:06.170 --> 19:09.140
I was always a champion.

19:09.980 --> 19:12.570
Those who lost to me
would disappear from before me.

19:14.250 --> 19:17.340
C'mon, cut it out...
you don't need to laugh so hard!

19:17.420 --> 19:18.380
But...

19:18.520 --> 19:20.110
You were different.

19:20.190 --> 19:22.180
- I've never seen a dragon do that!
- Well, that was Chibi's fault!

19:22.260 --> 19:24.160
Whether you won or lost...

19:24.220 --> 19:26.950
...you were never alone.

19:42.280 --> 19:45.400
I was always alone.

19:46.710 --> 19:49.310
What's different between you and I?

19:51.550 --> 19:53.350
That's right.

19:53.420 --> 19:54.890
Whether I win or lose...

19:55.490 --> 19:59.320
...I wish to continue fighting against you
until I have an answer to that.

20:00.960 --> 20:02.190
Continue fighting?

20:02.430 --> 20:05.360
That's right. As often as it takes.

20:08.570 --> 20:09.700
I understand.

20:10.100 --> 20:12.040
I promise that I'll fight against you.

20:12.170 --> 20:13.140
However...

20:20.780 --> 20:24.680
Right now, we must finish this battle.

20:32.160 --> 20:34.990
It doesn't look like
we'll get any closer with ease!

20:38.430 --> 20:40.330
I know.

20:40.600 --> 20:43.730
Fight against me after we put an end to this.

20:44.770 --> 20:47.760
When that time comes,
I'll be stronger than I am now.

20:48.010 --> 20:51.910
Then I'll just have to be even stronger.

20:52.480 --> 20:54.410
You really are a pest.

20:55.220 --> 20:57.380
Let's concentrate on ending
this fight against Kouhei.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.080
Let's go, Hikaru!

20:59.190 --> 21:00.150
Right.

21:03.260 --> 21:05.750
It might've been a blessing in disguise...

21:05.830 --> 21:07.920
...to have you obtain SinnSaber.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.360
If I had those powers...

21:15.970 --> 21:19.600
I may have ended up
being all alone for good.

21:56.740 --> 21:59.410
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.480 --> 22:02.180
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.250 --> 22:06.190
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.650 --> 22:10.350
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.420 --> 22:12.590
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.060 --> 22:17.160
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.600 --> 22:21.190
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.270 --> 22:23.930
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.000 --> 22:27.960
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.310 --> 22:31.740
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.810 --> 22:34.750
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.820 --> 22:39.680
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.350 --> 22:43.020
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.090 --> 22:45.790
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.860 --> 22:50.490
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.230 --> 22:53.930
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.000 --> 22:56.590
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.670 --> 23:01.300
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.980 --> 23:06.470
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.410 --> 23:13.080
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.490 --> 23:18.080
Next time

23:18.560 --> 23:19.650
What's going on?

23:19.730 --> 23:22.420
There's a heated battle going on against
each one of those Four Sacred Dragons!

23:22.560 --> 23:23.430
Fight, fight, fight!

23:23.500 --> 23:26.560
Of them, the one called Opal Siegel
is especially evil!

23:26.630 --> 23:27.530
The pits!

23:27.600 --> 23:29.800
It's sucked Maiko's group
into a different dimension...

23:29.870 --> 23:31.390
...and is attacking their minds!

23:31.470 --> 23:32.400
Abracadabra!

23:32.470 --> 23:35.410
You think maybe the Four Sacred Dragons
are really smart?!

23:36.340 --> 23:38.900
Next on Dragon Drive,
"Labyrinth of Darkness".

23:39.010 --> 23:42.240
Huh? What is Daisuke doing
on top of Opal Siegel?

23:42.350 --> 23:43.450
Labyrinth of Darkness
Could he be...

23:43.450 --> 23:43.480
Labyrinth of Darkness

23:43.480 --> 23:44.790
Labyrinth of Darkness
...an enemy?!

23:44.790 --> 23:45.110
Labyrinth of Darkness
